#: scenario8:scenario8_0BDCF5D5_00F9_416E_A51E_D122229A5F24
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 165793482670221572d21d7d51b2ad556c9112443700eaca2a5da3f59a362126
